kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.carp=Rivers, lakes and swamps. Any time of day.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.grass_carp=Rivers, lakes and swamps. Mostly during the day.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.catfish=Swamps, mangroves and rivers. Mostly at night.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.sweetfish=Clear rivers, best in cold rivers. During the day.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.mackerel=Oceans, including cold and deep oceans. Any time.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.yellow_croaker=Temperate and warm oceans, beaches. Mostly during the day.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.sea_bream=Temperate and warm oceans. Bites most at dawn and dusk.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.hairtail=Oceans at least 6 blocks deep. At night.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.grouper=Warm (coral) oceans. Mostly during the day. A strong fighter.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.tuna=Deep oceans only, water at least 8 blocks deep. Rare; Shrimp bait helps.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.anglerfish=Deep oceans at least 10 blocks deep, only at night, more in storms. Needs the Voyage Fishing Rod.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.octopus=Warm and temperate oceans at night.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.eel=Rivers, swamps and lakes at night, more in the rain. Fish Meal Bait helps.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.saury=Cold and temperate seas at night. Glow Bait helps.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.shrimp=Shallow water almost anywhere (up to 6 blocks deep).
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.crab=Beaches, swamps and shallow seas (up to 4 blocks deep).
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.oyster=Beaches and shallow seas (up to 5 blocks deep).
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.vanilla_cod=Oceans and beaches.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.vanilla_salmon=Rivers, lakes and cold oceans.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.vanilla_tropical_fish=Warm (coral) oceans.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.vanilla_pufferfish=Warm and temperate oceans.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.void_eel=The End's void, with the Ender Fishing Rod. The most common void catch. Eating it slows your fall for a while.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.purpur_shrimp=The End's void, with the Ender Fishing Rod. A pale purple shrimp.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.starfin=Rare, deep in the void (Ender Fishing Rod): the bait has to hang deep, so fit a Weighted Bobber. A long fight. Slow falling and night vision.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.smelt=Under the ice: fish through an Ice Hole or any gap in a frozen lake or sea. The most common ice fish, small and silvery.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.rainbow_trout=Under the ice (Ice Hole). A pink stripe down its side; puts up a fair fight.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.arctic_char=Under the ice (Ice Hole), less common, bites most at dawn and dusk. Orange belly, pale spots, a long fight.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.skipjack=Open seas by day, often in schools. Dry it on a Drying Rack for katsuobushi.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.blazefin=The most common lava fish (Lava Fishing Rod). Comes out cooked; a little fire resistance.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.lava_eel=Nether lava, with the Lava Fishing Rod. Comes out cooked; eating it gives a little fire resistance.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.basalt_crab=Scuttles in Nether lava (Lava Fishing Rod). Comes out cooked. Simmer two in the Stockpot for Basalt Crab Pot.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.magma_koi=Rare, only in lava at least 3 blocks deep (Lava Fishing Rod). A long fight. Fire resistance and regeneration.
