kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.golden_croaker=Open sea, only at dawn and dusk. Rare: a croaker scaled in gold.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.moon_jellyfish=Open and deep sea, only on full-moon nights. Craft one into four Glow Bait.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.glow_crab=Beaches, only on full-moon nights (up to 4 blocks deep). Steam it like any crab.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.chorus_carp=Any water in the End, with any rod. The most common End pond catch.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.chorus_jellyfish=Any water in the End. Goes into Void Seafood Soup.
kaleidoscope_fishing.habitat.ender_angler=Any water in the End, rare. Ender Maggot Bait draws it in. Fights hard; cut it up for Ender Pearls.
